;; inventory.sexp: every export of (curl), (curl unsupported) and (http-client), on
;; feat/m8-docs at fb62a0b (main), as Chez's library-exports lists them (logs/exports.txt),
;; each its kind as Chez evaluates it (kinds.sps, logs/kinds.txt). Written by inventory.py from
;; the export forms and a hand-written table of what each raises, each with a code citation.
;; Each entry: (export NAME (library L) (kind K) (topic T) (signature-at F:N) (signature
;; LINES) (prose LINES) (block-intro LINES) (group NAMES) (section (N TEXT)) (raises
;; (TYPE REASONS CITATION NOTE) ...) (comment-vs-code TEXT) (cites ((N TEXT) ...))).
;; LINES are ((LINE TEXT) ...), TEXT the comment after ';; ' verbatim. cites lists each
;; ADR, plan, slice, research path, date or record the entry's comment, block or section
;; names: the reference must copy none. Every binding also refuses an unthreaded Chez or one
;; older than 10.4.0 at import, a syntax violation (require-threaded.sls:79-89).
