  (block-intro ((436 "A token whose request has body stream takes its body from puts, into") (437 "a buffer of 64 KiB. libcurl asks for it with the request's head, or") (438 "once it has sent it, by version; an empty buffer pauses the transfer's sending, and a put or the") (439 "end resumes it. It is sent at most once, on a connection of its own: a") (440 "resend libcurl wants once a byte was handed fails the transfer,") (441 "body-not-replayable. The transfer's timeout runs while the producer") (442 "waits. An answer that ends the transfer early ends the upload: every") (443 "later put answers done, and curl-token-body-count says what was taken.") (444 "Over HTTP/2, a transfer that streams both ways sends only while its") (445 "response is read. A token whose request does not stream its body") (446 "refuses each of these, an assertion violation.")))
