  (prose ((33 "(curl-request-with-options REQUEST ((NAME . VALUE) ...)): a new") (34 "request, REQUEST's fields and the options it carries kept, with each") (35 "option attached after them, in order. NAME is the option's name") (36 "without CURLOPT_, in any case, as curl_easy_option_by_name reads it.") (37 "VALUE is an exact integer for a long, an enumerated-value or an off_t") (38 "option, a string for a string one, a list of strings for a string") (39 "list, and a bytevector for a blob, which libcurl copies. A refusal of a") (40 "name or a string is a &curl-request-error, field options, naming the") (41 "option, with one of the reasons embedded-nul, unknown-option,") (42 "owned-option, unsupported-type, repeated-option or line-break; a value") (43 "of the wrong shape or range is an assertion violation. curl-request-with") (44 "keeps the options a request carries. A libcurl that refuses a value as") (45 "the transfer is set up fails the transfer, setopt-failed, naming the") (46 "option.")))
