(export call-with-response-port
  (library (http-client)) (kind procedure) (topic "the high level: streams")
  (signature-at "src/http-client.sls:308")
  (signature ((308 "call-with-response-port : Session Symbol String Any ...") (309 "                          (Response Binary-Input-Port -> Any ...) -> Any ...")))
  (prose ((310 "(call-with-response-port SESSION METHOD URL KEY VALUE ... PROC): the") (311 "call, as http-request takes it, every response streamed, with one key") (312 "of its own:") (313 "  stream-buffer  the bytes of the body the call buffers, a positive") (314 "                 exact integer; 65536. A full buffer pauses the") (315 "                 transfer: over HTTP/1.1 the server's writes then stall") (316 "It is a streamed call: redirects and retries are decided as each head") (317 "arrives, by the rules above; a hop whose request sends no body has its") (318 "body read whole into the history, and one whose request sends a body") (319 "is cancelled at its head. At the final head PROC is called, on this thread, with") (320 "the response, its status, version, headers, URL and history whole and") (321 "its body and timings #f, and a binary input port over its body, and") (322 "the call answers PROC's values. When PROC returns or escapes, the port") (323 "is closed and a live transfer cancelled. The port feeds a producer as") (324 "it waits, so a server that answers while the body is sent is never") (325 "left without it. Its end is the end of the body, every time after; a") (326 "transfer's failure is raised by its read, the low level's condition") (327 "compounded with &http-exchange, and with &http-timeout when it was the") (328 "call's bound's 28, every time after. Inside the port's read, a") (329 "producer's raise or refusal is the call's for good: every later read") (330 "raises it, and the call raises it once PROC returns. The port is read") (331 "and closed on this thread alone, never by the producer; bytes Chez's") (332 "port has already buffered are served to any thread. Prefer") (333 "get-bytevector-some: a failure raised inside get-bytevector-n, -n! or") (334 "-all loses the bytes that call had read. The call's timeout-ms bounds") (335 "it whole, PROC's reading among it: a reader slower than the bound") (336 "meets &http-timeout. A PROC that never reads, and never returns,") (337 "starves its upload. A call whose retry runs out of time hands PROC the") (338 "retried response and a port over its body in memory; after a hop it") (339 "cancelled at its head, whose body it never read, the call raises") (340 "&http-timeout instead, PROC not called. A Chez engine's expiry during") (341 "the call is an escape, as any is: the transfer is cancelled and the") (342 "port closed. Once the engine resumes, the call meets that cancel: the") (343 "port's reads raise it, then Chez's error for a closed port. A last") (344 "argument that is no procedure is an") (345 "assertion violation, before anything else; a stream-buffer of #f is") (346 "one too, once the keys and the body are checked. The port feeds the") (347 "producer only when no piece is ready: a server that sends faster than") (348 "PROC reads leaves the upload waiting.")))
  (block-intro ())
