  (prose ((462 "(http-parallel SESSION SPECS KEY VALUE ...): each spec (METHOD URL KEY") (463 "VALUE ...), as http-request takes them, run in one group, its one key") (464 "limit, as call-with-request-group's; the responses, in SPECS' order.") (465 "Every spec is checked before any is submitted: SPECS and each spec") (466 "must be a list, else an assertion violation from http-parallel; each") (467 "call's method, keys and URL as go checks them, a producer refused,") (468 "stream-in-group; then its first request") (469 "by (curl)'s curl-request-check, as a submit would check it, its URL's") (470 "scheme and its CA file against the environment (ADR-0024) among it;") (471 "each refusal compounded with &http-exchange (ADR-0023, amended") (472 "2026-10-28). A refusal only an engine makes, its stop or its") (473 "failure, can still come once the calls run, as a failure among them.") (474 "The first call to fail raises, as it raised, once every other is") (475 "cancelled and its transfer has ended: the first the group saw fail,") (476 "ties in the order of their latest submits. What a caller's interrupt") (477 "handler or timer raises during the checks leaves as raised, as") (478 "http-request's does; each spec's checks are a critical section of") (479 "their own. An escape ends its group, a Chez engine's expiry among") (480 "them: resumed, it enters no call more, submits none it had not, and") (481 "raises its first failure, if any, or else the cancel of its first") (482 "call, in SPECS' order, not done; an expiry that runs out in the checks") (483 "lands after them, before the group is made, and the call goes on. It") (484 "refuses inside a critical section, before anything else.")))
  (block-intro ())
