(export http-request
  (library (http-client)) (kind procedure) (topic "the high level: verbs")
  (signature-at "src/http-client.sls:228")
  (signature ((228 "http-request : Session Symbol String Any ... -> Response")))
  (prose ((229 "(http-request SESSION METHOD URL KEY VALUE ...): METHOD, one of get,") (230 "head, post, put, patch and delete, on URL, an http or https URL. Its") (231 "keys are the session's, redirects, allow-downgrade and retry among") (232 "them, each replacing the session's value, a retry of #f none over the") (233 "session's policy, and:") (234 "  body         a bytevector, sent as it is, or a string, sent as its") (235 "               UTF-8 bytes, with no Content-Type of its own; or a") (236 "               producer, ( -> (U Bytevector Eof)), the body streamed") (237 "               as it gives it (ADR-0031, decision 2), below") (238 "  form         a list of (NAME . VALUE) strings, sent encoded as") (239 "               application/x-www-form-urlencoded, with that") (240 "               Content-Type, unless the headers name one, in any A to Z") (241 "               case") (242 "  params       a list of (NAME . VALUE) strings, encoded the same way") (243 "               and appended to the URL's query") (244 "  body-length  a producer's length, an exact natural below 2^63 - 1,") (245 "               sent as Content-Length; or #f, the body chunked over") (246 "               HTTP/1.1 and as DATA frames over HTTP/2; #f. Beside a") (247 "               body that is no producer, (curl)'s refusal,") (248 "               body-length-without-stream") (249 "  multipart    a multipart/form-data body's parts, (PART ...), each") (250 "               as (curl)'s request body (multipart PART ...) takes") (251 "               it, checked as it does: a relative path is resolved") (252 "               once, as the call starts, and each part's data copied") (253 "               then, so its retries and hops send the files and bytes") (254 "               it began with; a session's Content-Type header is") (255 "               dropped, and libcurl writes the type and its boundary") (256 "               (ADR-0039; the M8 plan, section 3.1). A multipart body") (257 "               is a whole body, no producer: a group takes one, a") (258 "               retry resends it, and a 307 or 308 keeps it") (259 "A producer is called on the caller's thread, only once libcurl has") (260 "asked for the body and has room, and never after it answered the eof") (261 "object; it answers a bytevector of a byte or more, or the eof object") (262 "at the end: (lambda () (get-bytevector-some port)) streams a port.") (263 "Its body is sent at most once, on a connection of its own (ADR-0032):") (264 "once the producer counts as called, libcurl having asked for the body") (265 "by a head or the call having called it, no retry takes the call, and a") (266 "redirect that keeps the body, a 307 or 308, and a 301 or 302 of every") (267 "method but post, raises &http-redirect-error, body-not-replayable. A") (268 "refused connect, before any ask, stays retryable. Its answer that is") (269 "neither a bytevector of a byte or more nor the eof object is an") (270 "assertion violation from the call; a piece that would take the body") (271 "past its body-length is &http-request-error, field body, its value the") (272 "producer, body-length-mismatch (ADR-0031, amended); each with its") (273 "&http-exchange, once its transfer is cancelled, before any of it is") (274 "put. Its own raise leaves the call as raised, once its transfer is") (275 "cancelled; a body that ends short of its body-length fails the") (276 "transfer, (curl)'s body-length-mismatch, alike on every libcurl. Such a") (277 "call is a streamed call, as call-with-response-port's is: it streams") (278 "its response too, and reads its body whole, to body-limit. A streamed") (279 "call's hop, a redirect it follows or a retry it takes, whose request") (280 "sends a body is cancelled at its head, its history entry's body and") (281 "timings #f; one whose request sends none is read whole (ADR-0031,") (282 "amended 2026-10-31). A whole body's call is no streamed call, and runs") (283 "as M5's. Over HTTP/2 on libcurl 8.20.0 and 8.23.0, a final 3xx, one") (284 "the call does not follow, that arrives before a body is sent whole,") (285 "streamed or whole, never ends but at the call's bound: pass a") (286 "timeout-ms. So does a whole body's call's hop: M5's drive cannot") (287 "cancel it at its head. A streamed call whose retry runs out of time") (288 "after a hop it cancelled at its head fails with &http-timeout, as with") (289 "no time left (decided by the maintainer, 2026-11-01).") (290 "body and form together are refused, multipart beside either, and any") (291 "of the three with get or head. A") (292 "call's header replaces every session header of its name, A to Z") (293 "folded, after the session's others; a call's User-Agent header sets") (294 "no user-agent field, and a call's user-agent field drops the session's") (295 "User-Agent header. Its timeout-ms bounds the whole call, from its") (296 "start: a 28 at that bound raises &http-timeout, compounded with the") (297 "low level's &curl-timeout. A redirect it does not follow raises") (298 "&http-redirect-error. Two Location headers fail the transfer as") (299 "(curl)'s &curl-protocol-error on the libcurls measured from 8.20.0,") (300 "8.20.0 and 8.23.0, and the first is followed on 7.85.0, 8.5.0 and") (301 "8.7.1.")))
  (block-intro ())
  (group (http-request http-get http-head http-post http-put http-patch http-delete))
  (section (227 "the verbs (ADR-0025)"))
