  (prose ((219 "Loads the lines into the session's jar, as (curl)'s") (220 "curl-cookie-jar-load! loads them, every line checked first, its") (221 "refusal cookie-line, naming the line's index alone.") (222 "Each waits for the engine, as a session's close does, with no bound;") (223 "a session without cookies is an assertion violation, and a closed") (224 "one's raises its engine's &curl-engine-error, stopped.")))
